							<div role="rowheader" class="techspecs-rowheader">
								Apple <br class="large" />Intelligence<sup class="footnote footnote-number"><a href="#footnote-4" aria-label="Dipnot 4" data-modal-close>4</a></sup></div>
							<div class="techspecs-column row" role="cell" aria-colspan="2">
								<div class="column column-apple-intelligence-image image-specs-apple-intelligence large-2 medium-3 small-12">
									<picture id="specs-apple-intelligence-1" class="specs-apple-intelligence" data-lazy>
										<source data-empty srcset="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAHAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==" media="(min-width:0px)" />
										<img src="/v/ipad-air/specs/d/images/specs/apple_intelligence__fjzyltrvp5qq_large.png" onload="__lp(event)" alt>
									</picture>
									<noscript>
								<picture class="specs-apple-intelligence">
									<source srcset="/v/ipad-air/specs/d/images/specs/apple_intelligence__fjzyltrvp5qq_small.png, /v/ipad-air/specs/d/images/specs/apple_intelligence__fjzyltrvp5qq_small_2x.png 2x" media="(max-width:734px)" /><source srcset="/v/ipad-air/specs/d/images/specs/apple_intelligence__fjzyltrvp5qq_large.png, /v/ipad-air/specs/d/images/specs/apple_intelligence__fjzyltrvp5qq_large_2x.png 2x" media="(min-width:0px)" />
									<img src="/v/ipad-air/specs/d/images/specs/apple_intelligence__fjzyltrvp5qq_large.png" alt>
								</picture>
							</noscript>
								</div>
								<div class="column column-apple-intelligence-copy large-10 medium-9 small-12">
									<p>iPad’inizde yerleşik olarak bulunan Apple&nbsp;Intelligence yazmanıza, kendinizi ifade etmenize ve işlerinizi kolayca halletmenize yardımcı oluyor. Olağanüstü gizlilik korumaları sayesinde sizden&nbsp;başka kimse, Apple&nbsp;bile verilerinize erişemiyor. Böylece içiniz hep rahat oluyor.</p>
									<p><a href="/tr/apple-intelligence/" data-analytics-title="learn more about apple intelligence" class="icon-wrapper"><span class="icon-copy">Apple Intelligence hakkında daha fazla bilgi edinin</span><span class="icon icon-after more"></span></a></p>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
					
